1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,616
I failed an exam I was sure I would
pass, and came home deeply sad.

2
00:00:07,192 --> 00:00:10,819
My mother saw my face: "My child, what's
wrong?"

3
00:00:10,819 --> 00:00:14,672
When I told her what happened, she told
me a story.

4
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:25,077
Long ago, a king was travelling to a
ceremony with his faithful servant.

5
00:00:26,567 --> 00:00:28,921
His horse stepped into a hole and fell.

6
00:00:28,921 --> 00:00:31,938
The king was thrown off, hurting his
hand and leg.

7
00:00:32,817 --> 00:00:36,647
But the servant calmly said, "Everything
is for the good."

8
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:40,704
Furious, the king threw the servant into
a pit and rode on alone.

9
00:00:43,358 --> 00:00:47,748
People seeking someone with no blemish
on their body, to offer as a sacrifice,

10
00:00:47,748 --> 00:00:48,648
seized the king.

11
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:51,799
But they saw his wounds and let him go.

12
00:00:51,799 --> 00:00:54,318
And the king remembered his servant's
words.

13
00:00:56,358 --> 00:01:00,383
The king went back, pulled the servant
out and told him everything.

14
00:01:00,383 --> 00:01:03,206
The servant said, "Everything is for the
good."

15
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:07,283
"How was throwing you into the pit
good?"

16
00:01:07,283 --> 00:01:11,484
"If I had gone with you, they would have
sacrificed me."

17
00:01:13,308 --> 00:01:16,228
When she finished, my sadness was gone.

18
00:01:16,228 --> 00:01:21,693
My result hadn't changed, but my outlook
had. Everything is for the good.
